// The container passes share one points-to analysis (SYCLHostFactsCache),
// kept across the passes that change the container: the noalias pass
// specializes a kernel visible to other TUs (a device copy, host globals and
// a getter copy, its launches redirected), then the constant pass and the
// noalias pass run again on the facts built before the specialization. They
// must give what each pass gives on a fresh analysis of the changed IR.
//
// RUN: cir-opt %S/infer-kernel-param-noalias-accessor.cir -split-input-file \
// RUN:   -pass-pipeline="builtin.module(cir-offload-infer-kernel-param-noalias{host-facts=ipo},cir-offload-propagate-sycl-kernel-args{host-facts=ipo},cir-offload-infer-kernel-param-noalias{host-facts=ipo})" \
// RUN:   -o %t.shared.cir 2> %t.shared.log
// RUN: cir-opt %S/infer-kernel-param-noalias-accessor.cir -split-input-file \
// RUN:   -cir-offload-infer-kernel-param-noalias='host-facts=ipo' -o %t.1.cir 2> %t.1.log
// RUN: cir-opt %t.1.cir -split-input-file -cir-offload-propagate-sycl-kernel-args='host-facts=ipo' \
// RUN:   -o %t.2.cir 2> %t.2.log
// RUN: cir-opt %t.2.cir -split-input-file -cir-offload-infer-kernel-param-noalias='host-facts=ipo' \
// RUN:   -o %t.fresh.cir 2> %t.3.log
// RUN: diff %t.shared.cir %t.fresh.cir
// RUN: cat %t.1.log %t.2.log %t.3.log | grep 'remark:' | sed 's/^.*remark:/remark:/' | sort > %t.fresh.log
// RUN: grep 'remark:' %t.shared.log | sed 's/^.*remark:/remark:/' | sort | diff - %t.fresh.log
// RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file=%t.shared.cir

// The specialization happened, and the second noalias run specialized the
// copy again: a copy of a copy, whose facts the cache reads under the
// original name through both (so the checks above are not vacuous).
// CHECK: cir.func @_Z9accKernelv.spec.noalias.0(
// CHECK: cir.func @_Z9accKernelv.spec.noalias.0.spec.noalias.0(
// RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REMARK --input-file=%t.shared.log
// REMARK: kernel @_Z9accKernelv.spec.noalias.0 arg 0 (accessor 'A'): noalias (buffer 'ba'
// REMARK: kernel @_Z9accKernelv.spec.noalias.0.spec.noalias.0 arg 0 (accessor 'A'): already noalias
